---
import CommunityLayout from '../../layouts/CommunityLayout.astro';
---

<CommunityLayout title="게시글 — AI정치연구소" description="AI정치연구소 자유게시판의 이야기를 읽어 보세요." active="board">
  <section class="c-page c-narrow" aria-label="게시글">
    <a class="c-link" href="/board">← 자유게시판</a>
    <p id="post-message" class="c-message post-message" role="status" aria-live="polite">게시글을 불러오는 중입니다.</p>
    <article id="post-article" class="c-card post-article" hidden>
      <header class="post-header">
        <p class="c-eyebrow">자유게시판</p>
        <h1 id="post-heading" class="c-heading post-heading"></h1>
        <div class="c-meta post-meta">
          <span id="post-author"></span>
          <time id="post-created"></time>
          <span id="post-updated" hidden>수정됨</span>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div id="post-content" class="post-content"></div>
      <div class="c-actions post-actions">
        <a class="c-button c-button-secondary" href="/board">목록으로</a>
        <div id="post-owner-actions" class="c-actions" hidden>
          <a id="post-edit" class="c-button c-button-secondary" href="/board/write">수정</a>
          <button id="post-delete" class="c-button c-button-secondary" type="button">삭제</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <aside id="post-join" class="c-card post-join" hidden aria-label="게시판 참여 안내">
      <p class="post-join-title">나누고 싶은 이야기가 있나요?</p>
      <p class="c-muted">가입하고 이메일을 인증하면 직접 글을 쓸 수 있어요.</p>
      <a id="post-join-link" class="c-button" href="/auth?mode=signup&amp;next=%2Fboard%2Fwrite">가입하고 글쓰기</a>
    </aside>
    <noscript><p class="c-message">게시글을 보려면 브라우저에서 자바스크립트를 켜 주세요.</p></noscript>
  </section>
  <script type="module" src="/community/post.js" is:inline></script>
</CommunityLayout>

<style>
  .c-page { max-width: 760px; }
  .post-message { margin-top: 28px; }
  .post-article { margin-top: 28px; padding: 28px; }
  .post-header { padding-bottom: 22px; }
  .post-header .c-eyebrow { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .post-heading { font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 30px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.6px; line-height: 1.4; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .post-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 16px; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; }
  .post-content { padding: 8px 0 36px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.9; }
  .post-actions { justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border, #e7e5e4); }
  .post-join { margin-top: 22px; }
  .post-join-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; margin: 0; }
  .post-join .c-button { margin-top: 8px; }
  @media(max-width: 600px) { .post-article { padding: 20px; } }
</style>
